    "UIName": "Suski",
    "Id": "chassisdef_suski_SSK-B",
    "Name": "Suski",
    "Details": "The Suski B configuration is modeled after the Septicemia B, relying on twin Large Pulse Lasers and four Small Pulse Lasers for concentrated energy firepower. With seven Improved Jump Jets, it boasts excellent agility and can reposition quickly during engagements.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Jammer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
