  "StockRole": "Skirmisher",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Suski is a medium OmniMech developed by Clan Coyote for the renewed invasion of the Inner Sphere. Drawing on Society Septicemia data and Stormcrow components, it features 13 tons of Ferro-Lamellor armor for enhanced durability. While sacrificing some pod space, most variants include a Supercharger to match the speed of its sibling, the Mikasi. The Suski’s blend of old tech and modern updates makes it a resilient and fast striker, ideal for rapid assaults and extended frontline engagements.",
